msgstr "Remove"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:619
msgid "Instalar Google Chrome"
msgstr "Install Google Chrome"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:629
msgid "Repositorios de addons"
msgstr "Addons repositories"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:630
msgid ""
"Cada repositorio se clona y se añade al addons_path de Odoo. «Pull» trae los "
"últimos cambios de todos y reinicia Odoo, sin redesplegar."
msgstr "Each repository is cloned and added to Odoo's addons_path. “Pull” fetches the latest changes of all of them and restarts Odoo, without redeploying."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:635
msgid ""
"Descarga los últimos commits de cada repositorio y reinicia Odoo. Si cambian "
"vistas o datos, actualiza el módulo en Odoo."
msgstr "Downloads the latest commits of each repository and restarts Odoo. If views or data change, upgrade the module in Odoo."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:643
msgid "¿Quitar este repositorio?"
msgstr "Remove this repository?"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:650
#, python-format
msgid "rama %(branch)s · principal (/mnt/extra-addons)"
msgstr "branch %(branch)s · main (/mnt/extra-addons)"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:659
#, python-format
msgid "rama %(branch)s · /mnt/repos/%(slug)s"
msgstr "branch %(branch)s · /mnt/repos/%(slug)s"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:669
msgid "Sin repositorios"
msgstr "No repositories"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:674
msgid "URL del repositorio"
msgstr "Repository URL"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:676
msgid "Rama"
msgstr "Branch"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:679
#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/todo_list.html:50
msgid "Añadir"
msgstr "Add"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:682
msgid ""
"Los repos privados usan el token de GitHub del dueño de la instancia "
"(Settings → GitHub)."
msgstr "Private repos use the instance owner's GitHub token (Settings → GitHub)."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:691
msgid "Actualización automática al hacer push"
msgstr "Automatic update on push"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:692
msgid ""
"Cada push a la rama de uno de los repositorios de esta instancia (el "
"principal o los de addons) la actualiza sola, como tarea con su log en "
"«Tareas recientes». Además, cada noche se actualiza aunque el repositorio no "
"tenga webhook. Solo se reinicia Odoo si el código cambió."
msgstr "Every push to the branch of one of this instance's repositories (the main one or the addons ones) updates it automatically, as a task with its log in “Recent tasks”. It is also updated every night even if the repository has no webhook. Odoo is only restarted if the code changed."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:694
#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/project_detail.html:274
msgid "Activa"
msgstr "Active"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:700
msgid "Al recibir un push"
msgstr "When a push arrives"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:709
msgid ""
"«Actualizar todos los módulos» ejecuta <code class=\"font-mono\">-u all</"
"code> en cada base de datos (campos, vistas y datos nuevos de los módulos) y "
"tarda más; «Pull» solo trae el código y reinicia Odoo."
msgstr "“Update all modules” runs <code class=\"font-mono\">-u all</code> on each database (new fields, views and data of the modules) and takes longer; “Pull” only fetches the code and restarts Odoo."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:714
msgid "Webhook de GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub webhook"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:718
msgid "Crear webhook en GitHub"
msgstr "Create webhook on GitHub"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:722
msgid ""
"Un webhook por repositorio basta: el push actualiza todas las instancias en "
"marcha que usan ese repositorio y rama con la actualización automática "
"activa, aunque el webhook sea de otra instancia. Lo crea en todos los "
"repositorios de la instancia con tu token de GitHub (necesita el permiso "
"<code class=\"font-mono\">admin:repo_hook</code>, o «Webhooks: lectura y "
"escritura» en un token fine-grained). O añádelo a mano en cada repositorio → "
"Settings → Webhooks → Add webhook:"
msgstr "One webhook per repository is enough: a push updates every running instance that uses that repository and branch with automatic update on, even if the webhook belongs to another instance. This creates it on all the instance's repositories with your GitHub token (it needs the <code class=\"font-mono\">admin:repo_hook</code> scope, or “Webhooks: read and write” on a fine-grained token). Or add it by hand in each repository → Settings → Webhooks → Add webhook:"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:732
msgid "Eventos"
msgstr "Events"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:734
msgid ""
"¿Generar un secreto nuevo? Los webhooks con el actual dejarán de funcionar "
"hasta actualizarlos."
msgstr "Generate a new secret? Webhooks using the current one will stop working until they are updated."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:737
msgid "Generar un secreto nuevo"
msgstr "Generate a new secret"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:750
#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:764
msgid "Variables de entorno"
msgstr "Environment variables"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:751
msgid ""
"Se pasan al contenedor de Odoo de esta instancia en cada despliegue (los "
"módulos las leen con <code class=\"font-mono\">os.environ</code>). Solo las "
"ve quien gestiona la instancia."
msgstr "They are passed to this instance's Odoo container on every deploy (modules read them with <code class=\"font-mono\">os.environ</code>). Only those who manage the instance can see them."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:759
msgid "Ver y editar"
msgstr "View and edit"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:768
msgid "Redesplegar ahora para aplicarlas"
msgstr "Redeploy now to apply them"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:772
msgid ""
"Una por línea, <code class=\"font-mono\">NOMBRE=valor</code>; se ignoran las "
"líneas vacías y las que empiezan por <code class=\"font-mono\">#</code>. "
"HOST, USER, PASSWORD y PORT los pone la plataforma. Las copias de la "
"instancia las heredan; las demos de «Modo test» no."
msgstr "One per line, <code class=\"font-mono\">NAME=value</code>; empty lines and lines starting with <code class=\"font-mono\">#</code> are ignored. HOST, USER, PASSWORD and PORT are set by the platform. Copies of the instance inherit them; “Test mode” demos don't."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:782
msgid "Instalar un módulo disponible"
msgstr "Install an available module"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:783
msgid ""
"Instala o actualiza en todas las bases de datos de la instancia un módulo "
"que ya está en sus addons (el tema, los de tus repositorios o los de Odoo). "
"La instancia necesita tener al menos una base de datos."
msgstr "Installs or upgrades, on every database of the instance, a module that is already in its addons (the theme, the ones from your repositories or Odoo's own). The instance needs at least one database."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/instance_detail.html:789
